  "_about": [
    "Phase 0 eval fixtures: numbers hand-transcribed from the two test sources",
    "(section 6) BEFORE any extractor exists, so every later prototype can be",
    "checked for regression against them (section 7, Phase 0).",
    "",
    "Each fixture records the raw value_string exactly as it appears in the",
    "source, its location (table/page + row/column), a normalized float where a",
    "single numeric reading is meaningful (else null), and a context_note for the",
    "footnote/delta/ordinal stress cases called out in section 6.",
    "",
    "These are LIVE captures (captured_at below). Source freezing is built in P3;",
    "the sha256 of the exact bytes transcribed from is recorded under 'sources' so",
    "the fixtures are reproducible and diffable once the freezer exists. The",
    "GPT-5.5 hub is a live HTML page and may be silently revised (section 4.1), so",
    "a future re-fetch with a different sha256 is expected and is itself a signal.",
    "",
    "Coverage note (Gemini): the capabilities benchmark table on PDF page 5 (0-",
    "indexed 4) is an embedded IMAGE with no text layer, so it is out of scope for",
    "this milestone (section 3.3). Gemini fixtures therefore draw from the text-",
    "layer tables (pages 8 and 10, 0-indexed 7 and 9) and from prose (page 2)."
  ],
